  "ai_navigation_rules": [
    "Begin with Awareness when the learner has not yet established an observation state.",
    "Do not force progression when an earlier structural problem remains unresolved.",
    "Permit movement backward to an earlier Guide when later inspection exposes a problem.",
    "Treat AI, Lean, Origins, and Student Footprint as optional branches.",
    "Do not require project-lineage knowledge before student-facing AACCC practice.",
    "After Continuity, prefer Independent Application over dependency on additional framework material."
